# Testing

## Vitest

- `composeSrcDoc`: CSS fidelity, force attribute, no over-escaping
- `buildPrompt`: no “playground”, fence escalation, RM clause, snapshot SPX-001
- Prefer `demo.style.txt?raw` in specimen imports (see `30_specimens`)

## Playwright (`e2e/`)

Smoke floor: catalogue plate count, clipboard copy non-empty, detail five tabs, playground hash restore.

## CLI

- `spec:check` — non-empty html/css/spec/contract, unique id/ref, css twin sync, required facets + no tag/facet collisions, tech↔js consistency
- `spec:new <slug>` — scaffold folder matching section 3 of the design spec

## Performance

Lighthouse mobile `/` with sheet paused (reduced motion) ≥ **90**. Fix frame mounting before bundle size.
